s profitability perspective.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Input cost levels for select materials have increased in recent months.","quote":"In the recent months, we are witnessing escalation in the cost levels of select inputs. We continue to mitigate these pressures by adopting a range of interventions across the value chain as well as by calibrating the price architecture.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects annual store additions to stay consistent with the outlook given by the Chairman.","quote":"On an annual basis we expect the trajectory of new store openings to remain broadly consistent in line with the outlook shared by the Chairman in the shareholders meeting.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Consumer sentiment remains generally positive, though discretionary spending is measured as shoppers prioritize value, convenience, and quality.","quote":"The sentiment continues to be broadly positive, with households balancing aspiration with financial discipline. The traction in discretionary categories remains calibrated, with consumers prioritising value, quality and convenience.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Trent aims to maintain a stable pricing structure across categories while focusing on operational efficiencies.","quote":"We believe a stable price architecture across categories, a consistent focus on driving efficiencies and maintaining a relatively stable margin profile over time would yield better salience for our brands.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Certain occupancy expenses like store rentals and partner fees follow variable payout models tied to revenues.","quote":"Incidentally, some of our occupancy costs including store rentals and fees to business associates have variable payout structures. The reported occupancy cost incorporates impact of IND AS 116 lease accounting.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Trent focuses on preserving a relatively steady margin profile over time to strengthen brand salience.","quote":"We believe a stable price architecture across categories, a consistent focus on driving efficiencies and maintaining a relatively stable margin profile over time would yield better salience for our brands.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"Capital expenditures are dedicated to new stores, existing portfolio upgrades, supply chain and warehousing expansion, and technology investments.","quote":"These commitments, including capital expenditure, cover opening of new stores, management of the existing portfolio, expanding warehousing and supply chain infrastructure along with a range of automation and technology related investments.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"During Q1 FY27, Trent added one Westside and 22 Zudio stores, consolidated three Zudio stores, and expanded into nine new cities.","quote":"In Q1FY27 we opened 1 Westside and 22 Zudio stores (including 1 store in the UAE) and consolidated 3 Zudio stores and expanded our presence to 9 new cities.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Trent continues to develop new brands including Burnt Toast and Samoh, emerging categories, and regional expansion such as Zudio in the Middle East.","quote":"Our newer brands (Burnt Toast and Samoh), emerging categories and new geographies including Zudio in the Middle East market are at varying stages of evolution.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Competitive intensity in the Indian fashion and lifestyle market has remained consistently high without material recent changes.","quote":"The competitive landscape remains asymmetrical due to varying scale, size and distribution channels across brands and players. We have not witnessed any material shifts in the competitive intensity in the recent past.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRENT_06082026134112_InvestorPresentation06082026Q1FY27.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Middle East disruptions present potential near-term risks through inflation, commodity price increases, and supply chain impacts.","quote":"However, the duration and intensity of disruptions in the Middle East along with its second order effect on supply chain, commodity prices and inflation in general has potential near term implications.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/